flowchart TB
    accTitle: Two execution paths
    accDescr: The router sends commands to per-instrument shards without journaling. The separate single-instrument engine enqueues a journal record before gateway application. Its persistence worker writes and flushes outside matching. Both publish complete event batches.

    subgraph Routed["Routed path (no journal)"]
        direction LR
        Router["Instrument router"] --> Commands["Command SPSC"]
        Commands --> Shard["MatchingShard<br/>Sequence, risk, book"]
        Shard --> RoutedEvents["Event SPSC"]
    end

    subgraph Journaled["Journaled path (one instrument)"]
        direction LR
        Admission["Engine admission"] --> Enqueue["Journal enqueue"]
        Enqueue --> Gateway["Gateway<br/>Risk and book"]
        Gateway --> EngineEvents["Event SPSC"]
        Enqueue -.-> Persistence["PersistenceWorker<br/>Write and flush"]
    end

    Routed ~~~ Journaled

